178
00:06:06,138 --> 00:06:08,560
當人們 做出這種有趣的事
when people do such, um, funny --

179
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,191
其實三言兩語就能說清
You know, the story is so short,

180
00:06:10,191 --> 00:06:11,894
-但又說來話長 -夠了 夠了
- but it-it-it would be so long -- - Enough, enough.

181
00:06:11,894 --> 00:06:13,341
我看不下去了
I cannot watch this.

182
00:06:13,341 --> 00:06:15,537
我覺得她要鋪墊出個故事了呢
I felt like she was building to something.

183
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:18,820
迪蘭和我要去法院結婚
Dylan and I are going to the courthouse to get married.

184
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:23,360
我們不是不想帶你
It's nothing personal, you know?

185
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,760
只不過 我們現在最不想要的
It's just...right now, the last thing we want

186
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:27,500
就是最后搞成了大型婚禮
is it to turn into a big production.

187
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:30,400
親愛的 假如這是你想要的
Well, honey, if that's what you want,

188
00:06:31,152 --> 00:06:34,077
作為你母親 雖然這顯然讓我十分痛苦
as your mother, obviously, it's incredibly painful,

189
00:06:34,077 --> 00:06:35,964
但你完全不必擔心
but that-that's none of your concern.

190
00:06:35,964 --> 00:06:38,694
我只希望你的婚禮
I just hope you have a wedding that's every bit

191
00:06:38,694 --> 00:06:42,295
能和我一直以來想象得一樣美好感人
as wonderful and beautiful as I always imagined.

192
00:06:42,469 --> 00:06:44,809
盡管我不能像想象中那樣出席
You know -- when I was gonna be part of it.

193
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:46,960
我就知道她不會介意
I knew she'd be cool.

194
00:06:47,969 --> 00:06:48,996
-是啊 -我們走
- Yeah! - Let's roll.

195
00:06:49,518 --> 00:06:50,749
老媽看起來挺受打擊的
Mom seemed pretty bummed about it,

196
00:06:50,749 --> 00:06:52,134
可這是我們想要的
but, you know, this is what we want.

197
00:06:52,134 --> 00:06:53,059
沒錯
Totally!

198
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:54,000
媽蛋
Damn it!

199
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:58,720
你怎能這樣對你母親
How could you do this to your mother?

200
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:03,400
他們怎么這么慢
What's taking them so long?

201
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,960
就是說啊 婚禮的主角又不是他們
I know. It's, like, this wedding isn't about them.

202
00:07:06,060 --> 00:07:07,740
是你和迪蘭 還有我
It's about you and Dylan and me!

203
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:08,380
來了
Coming!

204
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:09,660
真抱歉
So sorry.

205
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,640
別擔心 海莉
And don't worry, Haley.

206
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:15,160
我保證你幾乎不會注意到我們在場
I promise you will hardly know we are there at all.

207
00:07:15,220 --> 00:07:16,780
搞什么 你們穿得比我還正式
What? You're dressed nicer than me.

208
00:07:17,107 --> 00:07:18,780
我原本不想說什么 但你確定
Well, I wasn't gonna say anything, but are you sure

209
00:07:18,780 --> 00:07:20,400
你在這個特別的日子就穿這身衣服嗎
that's the outfit you want for your special day?

210
00:07:20,460 --> 00:07:22,960
這是海莉的婚禮 她想穿得多難看都隨她
It's Haley's wedding. She can dress as bad as she wants.

211
00:07:23,060 --> 00:07:23,360
沒錯
Right.

212
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:24,420
誰死了
Who died?

213
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,660
海莉和迪蘭要結婚了
Haley and Dylan are getting married.

214
00:07:26,660 --> 00:07:27,820
穿成這樣結婚嗎
Dressed like that?

215
00:07:28,085 --> 00:07:29,573
現在我還得帶上盧克
Now I have to invite Luke?

216
00:07:29,573 --> 00:07:30,979
你不想帶就不帶
Not if you don't want to.

217
00:07:31,060 --> 00:07:31,900
你真會說話
This feels great.

218
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:34,660
好吧 就帶上盧克 不能再加人了
Okay, that is it. Luke, but no one else.

219
00:07:34,898 --> 00:07:37,032
我媽發現你父母會出席
Hey, so, my mom found out your parents are coming,

220
00:07:37,032 --> 00:07:39,084
因為我告訴她了 現在她也正趕來
'cause I told her, and now she's on her way.

221
00:07:39,084 --> 00:07:40,141
我外公也來
And Grandpa's coming.

222
00:07:40,141 --> 00:07:41,608
你們會很喜歡他的
You guys are gonna love him.

223
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,700
但假如他叫你們殺了他 別下手
Oh, but if he asks you to kill him, don't.

224
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,320
我知道你在想什么
I know what you're thinking.

225
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,820
人太多了
That is a lot of people

226
00:07:46,820 --> 00:07:49,140
法院那沒有人情味的小房間擠不下
for a small, impersonal room at the courthouse,

227
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:51,880
我們也是這么想的
and we are on the same page.

228
00:07:52,420 --> 00:07:54,380
所以 為什么不在這結婚
So...why don't we just do it here?

229
00:07:54,403 --> 00:07:56,732
我有證婚人資格 我可以主持婚禮
I'm ordained. I can perform the ceremony.

230
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,720
這個主意太好了
That is such a great idea!

231
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,500
那樣的話 又簡單又私人化
That way, it's easy and intimate.

232
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,000
這正是你想要的 不是嗎
I mean, that's what you wanted, right?

233
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,680
你們先去法院
So, go down to the courthouse,

234
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:06,060
領結婚證 然后回來
get your marriage license, come back here,

235
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:07,180
我們都在這等著
and we'll all be waiting.

236
00:08:08,130 --> 00:08:09,577
好吧 我們立刻就得去
Fine. But let's go now.

237
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,480
我餓死了 法院的小賣部
I'm starving, and they make a great soft pretzel

238
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,440
有特別好吃的軟椒鹽餅
at the courthouse snack shop.

239
00:08:12,660 --> 00:08:13,560
你是怎么知道的
How do you know that?

240
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:14,960
我還是可以私奔的
I can still elope.

241
00:08:15,087 --> 00:08:16,380
別壞了我的好事
Don't you ruin this for me.

242
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:17,540
無所謂 無所謂
It's fine. It's fine.

243
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,440
等等
Wait.

244
00:08:21,099 --> 00:08:22,330
假如迪蘭的外公要來
If Dylan's bringing his grandfather,

245
00:08:22,580 --> 00:08:24,540
我們也必須邀請我爸和歌洛莉亞 不是嗎
that means we have to invite Dad and Gloria, right?

246
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,680
我想是的
I think so, yeah.

247
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,940
但他八成不會來 杰討厭臨時邀約
But he probably won't show. Jay hates last-minute plans.

248
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:30,080
他會說"老天 他們怎么不私奔"
He'll be like, "Oh, geez, why don't they just elope?"

249
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,200
外公你來啦
Grandpa?

250
00:08:34,437 --> 00:08:36,274
誰是乖乖仔
Who's a goody-woody boy?

251
00:08:36,274 --> 00:08:38,357
誰是犯困的乖仔
Who's a sleepy boy?

252
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:39,960
沒想到我會說這種話
I never thought I'd say this,

253
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,800
但我想念杰傷人的大男子主義
but I miss Jay's toxic masculinity.

254
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:44,520
至少他不是你親爹
At least he's not your real father.

255
00:08:45,262 --> 00:08:46,863
-我來接 我接 -我來接
- I'll get it! I got it! - I'll get it!

256
00:08:48,791 --> 00:08:50,074
-你好 -歌洛莉亞
- Hello? - Hey, Gloria.

257
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:53,200
海莉和迪蘭決定今天下午結婚
Haley and Dylan decided to get married this afternoon,

258
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:55,400
我知道老爸要談狗床生意
and I know Dad's got that dog-bed thing,

259
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:57,680
所以不必有壓力
so absolutely no pressure.

260
00:08:57,980 --> 00:08:59,900
好的 我們會盡快趕過去
Yes. We will be there as soon as we can.

261
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:02,840
杰 很遺憾不得不打斷
Jay, I am so sorry to break up

262
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:05,360
這個非常有趣非常正常的聚會
this really fun and super normal party,

263
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:09,080
但迪蘭和海莉決定現在結婚
but Dylan and Haley decided to get married right now,

264
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,700
克萊爾想讓我們過去
and Claire wants us there.

265
00:09:10,707 --> 00:09:12,769
老天 他們怎么不私奔
Oh, geez, why don't they just elope?

266
00:09:12,769 --> 00:09:15,570
其實亞瑟乖仔很喜歡婚禮
Actually, Arthur Goodboy loves weddings,

267
00:09:15,570 --> 00:09:18,402
它的粉絲們一直很想看它穿新西裝
and his followers have been dying to see him in his new tux.

268
00:09:18,402 --> 00:09:20,536
我可以帶個狗床 以防它想休息
I-I can bring a bed in case he gets tired.

269
00:09:23,234 --> 00:09:25,450
快看 有人心動了
Ooh, look. Somebody's got a crush.

270
00:09:25,450 --> 00:09:27,482
斯黛拉小姐可否賞光
Would Miss Stella do us the honor

271
00:09:27,482 --> 00:09:29,643
陪亞瑟乖仔一同出席婚禮
of escorting Arthur Goodboy to the wedding?!

272
00:09:29,643 --> 00:09:32,294
老天 當然 一萬個愿意
Gosh, yes! A thousand times yes!

273
00:09:36,264 --> 00:09:37,608
說出來你肯定不信
Well. You're not gonna believe this.

274
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,420
他們會來
They're coming.

275
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:39,820
假如他們會來 那我們是不是
Well, if they're coming, does that mean

276
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:40,920
也得邀請米奇和小卡
we need to invite Mitch and Cam?

277
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:43,340
想象一下不請的話他們得有多少狗血戲
Imagine the drama if we didn't.

278
00:09:43,457 --> 00:09:44,760
? 我該選擇誰 ?
♪ Who should I choose? ♪

279
00:09:44,780 --> 00:09:46,381
? 選一個都得失去另一個 ?
♪ Either way, I lose ♪

280
00:09:46,381 --> 00:09:47,735
? 我盯著槍扣 ?
♪ I stare at the gun ♪

281
00:09:47,735 --> 00:09:49,303
? 是選我女兒 還是選兒子 ?
♪ Is it daughter, is it son? ♪

282
00:09:49,324 --> 00:09:50,762
? 抉擇 ?
♪ Choices ♪

283
00:09:50,762 --> 00:09:51,819
-? 困難的抉擇 ? -? 抉擇 ?
- ♪ Impossible choices ♪ - ♪ Choices ♪

284
00:09:51,819 --> 00:09:53,583
-? 困難的抉擇 ? -? 困難 ?
- ♪ Impossible choices ♪ - ♪ Impossible ♪

285
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:54,340
? 抉擇 ?
♪ Choices ♪

286
00:09:54,774 --> 00:09:56,938
這就是為什么我不能邀請朋友來做客
This is why I can't have friends over.

287
00:09:56,938 --> 00:09:57,657
好吧
Okay.

288
00:09:57,657 --> 00:09:58,529
某人因為損人
Somebody just snarked her way

289
00:09:58,529 --> 00:09:59,709
沒有《蘇菲的抉擇》衛衣穿了
out of a "Sophie's Choice" Hoodie!

290
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:00,720
沒錯
That's right.

291
00:10:02,387 --> 00:10:03,433
克萊爾 什么事
Hey, Claire. What's up?

292
00:10:03,433 --> 00:10:06,008
海莉和迪蘭決定結婚了
So, Haley and Dylan decided to get married,

293
00:10:06,008 --> 00:10:07,794
你們要是不來他們會傷心死的
and they'd be devastated if you weren't there.

294
00:10:07,794 --> 00:10:09,794
當然 我們無論如何也不會錯過
Oh, of course! We wouldn't miss it for the world!

295
00:10:09,794 --> 00:10:10,872
告訴我們什么時候
Just tell us when.

296
00:10:10,872 --> 00:10:11,918
大約一小時后
In about an hour.

297
00:10:11,918 --> 00:10:14,175
我的天 我
Oh, my -- Hey, uh, let --

298
00:10:14,175 --> 00:10:15,654
我稍后給你回電話 好嗎
let me call you right back, okay?

299
00:10:16,073 --> 00:10:17,055
開什么玩笑
Are you kidding me?!

300
00:10:17,055 --> 00:10:19,141
就是說 該怎么辦 音樂劇還是婚禮
I know! What do we do -- a musical or the wedding?

301
00:10:19,380 --> 00:10:23,200
世上沒人被迫面臨過更殘酷的選擇
It's the cruelest decision anyone's ever been forced to make.

302
00:10:24,281 --> 00:10:27,103
-有人嗎 我們來了 -敲敲門
- Hello? We are here! - Knock, knock!

303
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,540
這都是些什么
What is all this?

304
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,340
克萊爾
Hey, Claire.

305
00:10:31,540 --> 00:10:32,540
這位是奧森
This is Orson

306
00:10:33,060 --> 00:10:35,320
而這當然就是亞瑟乖仔
and, of course, Arthur Goodboy.

307
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:37,300
多謝你邀請我們 我們愛愛情
Thanks for having us. We love love.

308
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:39,560
爸 能過來私下聊兩句嗎
Dad, can you come over here a second?

309
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,140
斯黛拉 你好啊
Hey, Stella.

310
00:10:41,231 --> 00:10:43,519
聽著 我覺得海莉不會想
So, listen, I don't think Haley

311
00:10:43,519 --> 00:10:45,982
回到有一屋子的陌生人和狗的家
wants to come back to a house full of strangers and dogs.

312
00:10:45,982 --> 00:10:47,387
克萊爾 我得抓住這個機會
Claire, I've got to have this,

313
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,060
而且她都不會感覺到他們在這的
and she's never gonna know they're even here.

314
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:52,160
好吧 這話說的時機不太好
Okay, that's bad timing.

315
00:10:52,322 --> 00:10:54,077
動起來 動起來 大家都動起來
Okay, okay, let's -- let's go, let's go, let's go.

316
00:10:54,077 --> 00:10:54,908
動起來 來忙活起來
Let's go. Let's get it going.

317
00:10:54,908 --> 00:10:56,427
你們著什么急 我以為你們...
What's your hurry? I thought you...

318
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,200
兩個喜歡婚禮呢
guys love weddings.

319
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:00,200
你準備說"你們這種人"是不是
You were gonna say "You people," Weren't you?

320
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:00,820
有證據嗎
Prove it.

321
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:02,100
我們拿著音樂劇的票
We have theater tickets,

322
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:03,500
如果現在婚禮開始的話
and if we get this wedding started,

323
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,100
我們還能趕上《蘇菲的抉擇》的開場
we can still make curtain for "Sophie's Choice."

324
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,140
為了看那個音樂劇
I would murder my entire family

325
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:08,580
我愿意干掉自己全家親友
and all of their friends to see that musical.

326
00:11:08,760 --> 00:11:09,920
這人懂行
This guy gets it.

327
00:11:11,220 --> 00:11:12,540
看看這是誰呀
Look who's here!

328
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,960
別擔心 我穿褲子了
Don't worry. I'm wearing pants.

329
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:16,320
至少你們看起來是的
As far as you know.

330
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:18,380
你好啊 弗蘭克
Oh, well, hello, Frank.

331
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:20,820
謝謝你 差不多算出席了
And thank you for...sort of making it.

332
00:11:20,866 --> 00:11:22,559
-真要這樣嗎 -你邀請了你爸爸
- Really? - Well, you invited your dad.

333
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:24,385
-我還能不邀請我爸爸嗎 -我不知道了
- What was I supposed to do? - I don't know.

334
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:26,460
你好啊 這是亞瑟乖仔嗎
Hey! Is that Arthur Goodboy?

335
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,780
我是超級粉絲
Big fan!

336
00:11:27,940 --> 00:11:29,700
早就期待看它穿西裝的樣子了
Been waiting to see him in his tux.

337
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,220
法拉
Farrah.

338
00:11:31,587 --> 00:11:33,475
-菲爾 -很高興見到...
- Phil. - It is so delightful to see --

339
00:11:35,999 --> 00:11:37,641
天啊
Oh. Gosh.

340
00:11:37,641 --> 00:11:39,283
你能相信我們的孩子要結婚了嗎
Can you believe our babies are getting married?

341
00:11:39,283 --> 00:11:40,185
我能
I can.

342
00:11:40,340 --> 00:11:42,640
我在秘魯的一叢篝火里見到了這個景象
I saw it in a vision at a campfire in Peru.

343
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:44,420
這是我的父親 伯特
This is my father, Bert.

344
00:11:44,638 --> 00:11:46,044
很榮幸能...
Oh, it's such an honor to --

345
00:11:46,044 --> 00:11:47,634
伏特加
Vodka!

346
00:11:49,389 --> 00:11:50,446
好漂亮的裙子
What a lovely dress.

347
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,360
其實這是薩滿教的婚禮禮服
It's actually a shamanic wedding robe

348
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,380
產自南美
from South America.

349
00:11:53,580 --> 00:11:55,720
我每次主持儀式都穿
I wear it at every ceremony I officiate.

350
00:11:56,253 --> 00:11:57,936
這就有點尷尬了
Ohhh. This is awkward.

351
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,160
我要主持儀式
I'm doing the ceremony.

352
00:12:00,620 --> 00:12:03,200
但這是我想了一輩子的事啊
But this is something I've dreamed about all of my lives.

353
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:05,240
媽 這是什么情況
Mom, what the hell is going on?

354
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,180
寶貝 其實沒有看上去那么糟啦
Oh, honey, honey, it's not as bad as it looks.

355
00:12:10,420 --> 00:12:14,460
你看 還是小規模 又簡潔又...
See, it's still small and simple and --

356
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:15,020
別幫倒忙
Not helping.

357
00:12:15,829 --> 00:12:18,096
怎么了 我們要在她步向祭壇時奏樂啊
What? We were gonna play her down the aisle.

358
00:12:18,096 --> 00:12:20,548
對 沒有風笛伴奏的婚禮會遭受厄運
Yeah. Bad luck to get married without bagpipes.

359
00:12:20,548 --> 00:12:23,031
我媽的第一個婚禮 沒有風笛
My mom's first wedding -- no bagpipes.

360
00:12:23,031 --> 00:12:25,832
我媽的第二個婚禮 有風笛
My mom's second wedding -- bagpipes.

361
00:12:25,832 --> 00:12:28,315
六個月之后 還沒離婚
Six months later, she's still married.

362
00:12:28,315 --> 00:12:29,721
我的意思是 這就是科學啊
I mean, that's just science.

363
00:12:29,926 --> 00:12:30,902
這又是什么
Now what?

364
00:12:31,003 --> 00:12:33,086
我們需要食物 所以
Oh, well, we needed food, so...

365
00:12:33,086 --> 00:12:34,359
你們好啊 小情侶
Hola, lovebirds.

366
00:12:34,359 --> 00:12:35,898
這真是場災難
Oh, this is a disaster.

367
00:12:35,898 --> 00:12:39,201
我理解 不過我們也沒法選擇兒時的家
I know, but we can't pick our childhood homes.

368
00:12:39,201 --> 00:12:41,171
別擔心 我能解決好一切的
Don't worry. I can fix everything.

369
00:12:41,171 --> 00:12:42,967
不要著急 慢慢去換你的衣服吧
Just take your time changing your clothes.

370
00:12:42,967 --> 00:12:44,189
這就是我要穿的
Oh, this is what I'm wearing.

371
00:12:44,270 --> 00:12:45,512
你太搞笑了
You're hilarious.

372
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:48,380
讓我見見這對恩愛情侶
Let me see the happy couple.

373
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,580
恭喜你 海莉
Congratulations, Haley.

374
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,000
恭喜你 安迪
Congratulations, Andy.

375
00:13:00,620 --> 00:13:03,500
抱歉 寶貝 我知道你有點生氣
Sorry. Honey, I know you're a little annoyed.

376
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:05,340
真是不好意思我讓你這么想了
Oh, I'm so sorry I gave you that impression.

377
00:13:05,460 --> 00:13:06,680
我都快氣死了
I'm a lot annoyed.

378
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:07,740
不過這樣更好
But it's better.

379
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:11,140
這樣的話 你就能被愛你的人所環繞
This way, you'll be surrounded by people who love you.

380
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:12,320
就是她
That's her.

381
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:16,140
恭喜你 我真為你高興
Congratulations! I am so happy for you.

382
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:16,720
盧克
Luke?

383
00:13:17,430 --> 00:13:18,405
這是安娜貝爾
Uh, this is Annabelle.

384
00:13:18,405 --> 00:13:19,462
我們剛在交友軟件上認識
We just met on Tinder.

385
00:13:19,462 --> 00:13:21,175
不過我們還沒來得及做什么
But we haven't done anything yet.

386
00:13:21,514 --> 00:13:22,458
你們猜怎么著 寶寶們
Guess what, babies.

387
00:13:22,458 --> 00:13:23,957
今天你們能嘗嘗酒的滋味了
You're gonna taste some wine today!

388
00:13:24,869 --> 00:13:26,233
既然婚禮快開始了
So, if we're gonna get this thing started,

389
00:13:26,233 --> 00:13:27,639
你是不是應該上樓換個衣服
maybe you should go up and change, huh?

390
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:29,455
再說最后一次 這就是我
Oh, for the last time, this is what I'm --

391
00:13:29,455 --> 00:13:30,101
算了 我去換
Screw it. I'm changing.

392
00:13:30,101 --> 00:13:31,281
-不 不用 -不用換 如果那就是
- No, don't - No, don't change, if that's --

393
00:13:31,281 --> 00:13:33,179
-真是的 -對不起 我錯了
- Damn it! What - Sorry. I'm sorry.

394
00:13:33,374 --> 00:13:34,648
歌洛莉亞
Gloria, Gloria.

395
00:13:35,170 --> 00:13:36,124
幫我個忙
Do me a favor.

396
00:13:36,124 --> 00:13:38,094
往我的電視機里放點臘腸
Put some salami in my TV.

397
00:13:38,094 --> 00:13:40,300
不管這是什么的暗號 我都不答應
Whatever that is a code for, the answer is no.

398
00:13:40,300 --> 00:13:41,623
好吧 那我自己來
Okay, fine. I'll do it myself.

399
00:13:41,623 --> 00:13:44,014
拖住奧森一小會兒
Keep Orson occupied for about a minute.

400
00:13:44,209 --> 00:13:45,553
亞瑟乖仔 過來
Arthur Goodboy, come.

401
00:13:45,553 --> 00:13:46,796
亞瑟乖仔 過來
Arthur Goodboy, come.

402
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:48,320
奧森先生
Mr. Orson.

403
00:13:49,944 --> 00:13:53,361
我想知道 你生活的一切都是你的狗狗嗎
Um, I need to know -- is your whole life your dog?

404
00:13:53,361 --> 00:13:56,080
不不 我對單人喜劇也有所涉獵
Oh, no. I also dabble in stand-up comedy.

405
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:58,748
我以前會把自己的段子給亞瑟乖仔試講一遍
In fact, I used to try out all of my material on Arthur Goodboy

406
00:13:58,748 --> 00:14:01,230
直到后來善待動物組織指控我拿動物做試驗
until I got in trouble with PETA for animal testing.

407
00:14:04,165 --> 00:14:05,140
話說回來 亞瑟去哪了
Speaking of, where is Arthur?

408
00:14:05,140 --> 00:14:06,309
我相信它沒事的
I'm sure he's fine.

409
00:14:06,309 --> 00:14:07,817
亞瑟 亞瑟
Arthur? Arthur?

410
00:14:07,817 --> 00:14:10,742
它在活動室里 狼吞虎咽什么冷切腸
He's in the family room, wolfing down some cold cuts.

411
00:14:10,742 --> 00:14:12,506
不不不 它消化不了那個
No, no, no. He can't digest that.

412
00:14:12,568 --> 00:14:13,964
西裝可是租來的還要還回去
And that tuxedo is rented.

413
00:14:14,107 --> 00:14:15,779
別 等一等
No, please! Wait!

414
00:14:18,149 --> 00:14:19,432
住手
Aah! Stop!

415
00:14:19,432 --> 00:14:20,242
住手 什么 不要
Stop? What, no!

416
00:14:20,242 --> 00:14:22,746
它很喜歡這個床 別啊 它喜歡在里面
He's enjoying the bed. No, he loves it in there.

417
00:14:22,746 --> 00:14:23,639
別說了
Don't.

418
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:24,860
那個機器人什么都跟我說了
The robot told me everything.

419
00:14:25,126 --> 00:14:27,168
-對不起 但是我以為只要它 -別說了
- Oh, I'm sorry, but I thought once he got - Stop! Unh!

420
00:14:27,353 --> 00:14:28,440
我會待到婚禮結束
I will stay for the wedding

421
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:31,251
免得不毀掉海爾西和德里克的大喜日子
so as not to ruin Halsey and Derek's special day,

422
00:14:31,251 --> 00:14:33,878
但是我們的合作沒戲了
but this partnership is off.

423
00:14:35,620 --> 00:14:36,600
我這是在做什么
What am I doing?

424
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:38,360
讓自己丟人現眼
Making a fool of yourself --

425
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:40,500
你一整天都在這樣
what you have done the whole day.

426
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:41,820
對 我表現得像個傻瓜
Yeah. I'm acting like an idiot.

427
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:44,460
這個點子太蠢了
I mean, this was a stupid idea,

428
00:14:44,460 --> 00:14:46,620
在我這把年紀還想重新創業
trying to launch a whole new business at my age.

429
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:47,980
我還以為會很有意思
I thought it would be fun,

430
00:14:48,088 --> 00:14:50,694
我早就該知道的 我該金盆洗手了
but I should've known I-I need to hang it up.

431
00:14:51,340 --> 00:14:52,180
我想靜靜
I need a second.

432
00:14:54,367 --> 00:14:56,758
狗床確實很滑稽很悲哀
Dog beds are ridiculous and sad.

433
00:14:56,758 --> 00:14:58,358
但是對杰來說很重要
But they're important to Jay.

434
00:14:58,440 --> 00:15:01,400
我想愛一個人就意味著你也需要尊重他們
So I guess that loving someone means that you have to respect

435
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:04,200
愚蠢又令人惡心的夢想
their idiotic, nauseating dreams.

436
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:05,800
你好 老兄弟
Hey, old-timer.

437
00:15:06,248 --> 00:15:07,695
我喜歡你的輪椅
I dig those wheels.

438
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:10,660
為什么這個吸塵器在跟我說話
Why is this vacuum cleaner talking to me?!

439
00:15:10,782 --> 00:15:12,630
我們剩的時間不多了
Okay, we are definitely cutting it close,

440
00:15:12,660 --> 00:15:13,660
不過我覺得我們能趕上的
but I think we're gonna make it.

441
00:15:13,831 --> 00:15:15,657
你知道嗎 按傳統的婚禮儀式
You know, it's just that, uh, traditionally,

442
00:15:15,657 --> 00:15:17,699
是新娘的爸爸對這些事情說了算
the father of the bride calls the shots at these things.

443
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:19,120
老天爺 菲爾
Oh, my goddess, Phil.

444
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:21,500
一定要這樣的話 那我們徹底回到傳統婚禮好了
By all means, let's return to traditional weddings.

445
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,540
或許你愿意討論一下海莉的嫁妝
Perhaps you'd like to discuss the matter of Haley's dowry.

446
00:15:24,540 --> 00:15:26,920
你們準備陪嫁牲畜還是土地呢
Are you prepared to offer livestock or land?

447
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:28,380
法拉 如果這是在你們的
Farrah, I would defer to you

448
00:15:28,380 --> 00:15:30,100
圓頂帳篷里我會聽你的
if this were happening in your yurt.

449
00:15:30,300 --> 00:15:30,700
好吧
Fine.

450
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:33,280
我們來擲橡子決定吧
We'll settle this over a game of acorns.

451
00:15:35,020 --> 00:15:36,100
伸出你的手來
Put out your hands.

452
00:15:37,140 --> 00:15:38,560
橡子 說話吧
Acorns, speak.

453
00:15:40,045 --> 00:15:41,871
對不起 菲爾
Oh. Sorry, Phil.

454
00:15:41,871 --> 00:15:42,518
三局兩勝
Best of 3.

455
00:15:42,518 --> 00:15:43,287
這是在干什么
What am I doing?

456
00:15:43,287 --> 00:15:45,360
好了 你們倆 停下來
Okay, both of you, stop!

457
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,796
你們兩個都主持 行嗎
You can both officiate, all right?

458
00:15:46,796 --> 00:15:48,674
但是那不會花兩倍的時間嗎
Yeah, but won't that take twice as long?

459
00:15:48,674 --> 00:15:50,828
不管誰主持 能不能抽出點時間
Uh, whoever's officiating, if you can carve out some time

460
00:15:50,940 --> 00:15:51,860
讓我讀一下我寫的詩
for a poem I've written.

461
00:15:52,020 --> 00:15:54,120
這是《貝奧武夫》和《電子情書》的結合版
It's sort of a "Beowulf" Meets "You've Got Mail."

462
00:15:54,235 --> 00:15:55,712
天啊 求求不要讀詩了 別啊
Oh, God, no! No poems! No!

463
00:15:55,712 --> 00:15:56,297
-沒人想聽詩 -誰要聽啊
- Nobody wants a poem! - No one wants that!

464
00:15:56,297 --> 00:15:58,349
-快點吧 流程走下去 -繼續下去
- Come on! Let's move this thing along! - Get it going!

465
00:15:58,349 --> 00:16:00,145
你們得交出《蘇菲的抉擇》票
You need to give your "Sophie's Choice" ticket

466
00:16:00,280 --> 00:16:01,440
給那個養狗怪人
to the dog weirdo.

467
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:03,320
我爸居然想看音樂劇嗎
My dad wants to see a musical?

468
00:16:03,460 --> 00:16:05,220
不是 是另一個養狗怪人
No, the other dog weirdo.

469
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:07,980
你們沒看到他聽到時有多興奮嗎
Didn't you see how excited he got when he heard about it?

470
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,780
但這事絕對沒門 您慢走
Yeah, well, that's not happening. No, thank you.

471
00:16:09,900 --> 00:16:11,860
想想這些年來
Think about all the sacrifices

472
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:13,900
你父親為你做的犧牲啊
that your father has made for you.

473
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,120
但我真的不在意啊
Oh, I just don't care.

474
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,760
你們反正也來不及趕到
You're not gonna make it anyways.

475
00:16:16,797 --> 00:16:18,828
我們能趕到 婚禮馬上就要開始了
Y-Yes, we are, 'cause the wedding's about to start.

476
00:16:18,860 --> 00:16:20,380
-他們來啦 -是嗎
- Here they come. - Is it?

477
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:21,820
不好意思
Excuse me.

478
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:24,880
在我們開始這場美好的儀式之前
Um, before we start this beautiful ceremony,

479
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:27,220
我們在座各位何不輪流一下
why don't we go around the room

480
00:16:27,241 --> 00:16:30,535
聊聊這場婚禮對他們代表的意義
and talk about what this wedding means to us?

481
00:16:30,535 --> 00:16:32,207
我想應該沒人想被拱上臺做出發言吧
Yeah, I don't think anybody wants to be put on the spot.

482
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:33,560
就繼續把婚禮流程走完吧
Let's just get on with the wedding.

483
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:36,520
對我來說 婚姻不只是兩個人心的聯結
To me, a marriage is not just the joining of two hearts.

484
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:38,240
還是兩個家庭合而為一
It's the melding of families.

485
00:16:38,374 --> 00:16:39,594
請聽我說這句
And can I just say this --

486
00:16:39,594 --> 00:16:41,298
-不聽 坐下 -不聽 坐下
- No! Sit down! - No! Sit down!

487
00:16:46,746 --> 00:16:48,357
去吧 去吧 這就對啦
Go on, go on. There you go.

488
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:50,720
撒的是 泡沫塑料嗎
Are those... packing peanuts?

489
00:16:50,727 --> 00:16:52,645
我只有十分鐘準備 還沒經費
I had 10 minutes and no budget.

490
00:16:52,645 --> 00:16:54,277
-真的要發生了呢 -是啊
- This is happening. - Yep.

491
00:16:55,046 --> 00:16:56,924
這只狗在對斯黛拉做什么啊
What's this dog doing to Stella?

492
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:58,460
壞狗狗 不許日
Bad dog! No humping!

493
00:16:58,660 --> 00:17:00,240
不許羞辱他 這是她的錯
Don't shame him! That's her fault.

494
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:01,480
她自己在他臉上扭屁股
She's wagging her hips in his face!

495
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:02,520
那是她腰不好
That's her dysplasia.

496
00:17:02,740 --> 00:17:03,840
而且都2019年了
And it's 2019.

497
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:05,060
他怎么可以強搶民女呢
What he did is not okay!

498
00:17:05,500 --> 00:17:07,000
糟糕 我是不是在動啊
Uh-oh. Am I moving?

499
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:08,000
好像有東西卡住了
Something's stuck!

500
00:17:10,795 --> 00:17:12,745
-菲爾 我跌倒了 -看 就是這樣
- Phil, I'm falling! - See, this -- this --

501
00:17:12,745 --> 00:17:13,853
這就是為什么我不想請人來
this is why I didn't want anyone here!

502
00:17:14,100 --> 00:17:15,720
這就是為什么我想私奔
This is why I wanted to elope!

503
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:19,080
海莉 我知道你不高興 但他們是你的家人啊
Haley, I know you're upset, but this is your family.

504
00:17:19,140 --> 00:17:20,160
你誰啊
Who are you?!

505
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:21,700
好 夠了 夠了
Okay, enough! Enough.

506
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:23,480
迪蘭 海莉 現在都到廚房來
Dylan, Haley, in the kitchen -- now!

507
00:17:23,487 --> 00:17:24,554
鞋真好看
Nice shoes!

508
00:17:24,554 --> 00:17:26,216
很抱歉 各位
I am, uh, so sorry, folks.

509
00:17:26,216 --> 00:17:27,755
可能 可能需要大家等一小段時間
This is -- This is gonna take a little while.

510
00:17:27,755 --> 00:17:29,869
或許艾麗克斯和比爾可以給大家奏點音樂
Maybe Alex and Bill can play something.

511
00:17:29,869 --> 00:17:30,977
-不要 -別了
- No! - No!

512
00:17:30,977 --> 00:17:32,824
-我們是趕不上了對吧 -好吧 不行
- We're not gonna make it, are we? - Okay, no.

513
00:17:32,824 --> 00:17:34,783
我們估計來不及 感覺就沒戲了
We're not gonna make it! It -- It doesn't look like it.

514
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:36,260
不好意思
Hey, um...

515
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:39,060
我爸爸希望你能收下這些票
Hi. My dad wanted you to have these tickets.

516
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:41,060
我勒個大丹犬 太謝謝你們了
Great Danes! Thank you!

517
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:43,520
別著急 你還有一件事情沒做呢
Not so fast. You still have something to do.

518
00:17:45,290 --> 00:17:46,972
聽 聽我說
Listen. Listen to me.

519
00:17:47,260 --> 00:17:48,200
媽 我不想聽
I don't want to hear it, Mom.

520
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:50,000
跑吧
Run.

521
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:51,800
-什么 -是的
- What?! - Yeah.

522
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:54,160
很抱歉事情沒按我們料想中的發展
We're really sorry that this all got away from us.

523
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:57,400
但我們真正在乎的是你開心
But all we care about is that you're happy.

524
00:17:57,500 --> 00:18:00,040
而你應該擁有你想要的婚禮
And you should have the wedding you want.

525
00:18:01,060 --> 00:18:02,140
你媽媽說得對
Your mom's right.

526
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:05,180
我們也私定終身過 現在想起來
We eloped, and I still think of it

527
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:06,800
還覺得那是我人生中最美好的一段時光之一
as one of the best days of my life.

528
00:18:07,215 --> 00:18:09,514
到現在還感覺那是我們倆最后獨處的日子
It still seems like the last day we were alone.

529
00:18:12,500 --> 00:18:12,940
這...
That's...

530
00:18:13,330 --> 00:18:14,254
小寶貝
Oh, honey.

531
00:18:14,254 --> 00:18:15,762
你們四個人快上路吧
The four of you better get going, huh?

532
00:18:15,762 --> 00:18:16,656
是啊
Yeah.

533
00:18:17,116 --> 00:18:18,317
我的寶貝們啊
Ohh, my babies.

534
00:18:18,317 --> 00:18:20,205
愛你們
I love you, guys.

535
00:18:20,620 --> 00:18:21,900
再見 再見啦
Bye. Bye.

536
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,340
你還好嗎
You okay?

537
00:18:27,340 --> 00:18:28,340
其實不好
Not really, no.

538
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,840
我好難過自己不能在場陪伴
I hate that we're not gonna be there.

539
00:18:31,220 --> 00:18:33,640
我一直覺得她結婚時我一定會在場
I always assumed we would be at her wedding.

540
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:35,180
這樣是不是很自私啊
Is that selfish?

541
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:36,560
當然不
No.

542
00:18:37,595 --> 00:18:38,622
這樣才公平啊
It's only fair.

543
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:41,600
她也參加了我們的婚禮
She was at ours.

544
00:18:41,935 --> 00:18:43,045
是啊
Mm. She was.

545
00:18:46,360 --> 00:18:47,280
快看
Look at this.

546
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:50,700
他在一分鐘前發了文 已經有五千贊了
He posted one minute ago. It's already got 5,000 likes.

547
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:51,840
謝謝你
Thank you.

548
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:53,520
我愛你嘛
I love you.

549
00:18:53,878 --> 00:18:57,623
而比狗床還不性感的 就是半途而廢了
And the only thing less sexy than a dog bed is a quitter,

550
00:18:57,623 --> 00:18:59,070
我可不想嫁給半途而廢的人
and I didn't marry a quitter.

551
00:18:59,070 --> 00:19:00,250
我娶了個天使
I married an angel.

552
00:19:00,250 --> 00:19:01,624
是的
Yes, you did!

553
00:19:01,624 --> 00:19:03,543
能請大家注意聽我說一下嗎
Could I have everyone's attention? Um...

554
00:19:04,107 --> 00:19:05,646
我想說在場的大多數人
I just want to say that most of you

555
00:19:05,646 --> 00:19:07,555
都對我們十分重要
are very important to us.

556
00:19:07,555 --> 00:19:09,340
但婚禮取消了 感謝你們的到來
But the wedding's off, and thanks for coming.

557
00:19:09,340 --> 00:19:10,633
-什么 -你耍我們啊
- What?! - You got to be kidding me!

558
00:19:10,633 --> 00:19:12,818
我真的服了 我們這是血海深仇
This is an outrage. I will never forgive you.

559
00:19:12,818 --> 00:19:14,716
你們倆有興趣給在場各位唱個歌嗎
Perhaps the two of you would like to sing a song?

560
00:19:14,768 --> 00:19:16,276
? 抉擇 困難 ?
♪ Choices, impossible ♪

561
00:19:16,276 --> 00:19:17,487
-? 抉擇 ? -? 抉擇 困難 ?
- ♪ Choices ♪ - ♪ Choices, impossible ♪

562
00:19:17,487 --> 00:19:18,605
-? 抉擇 ? -? 為什么有那么多 ?
- ♪ Choices ♪ - ♪ Why are there so many ♪

563
00:19:18,605 --> 00:19:19,980
? 聲音 ?
♪ Voices ♪

564
00:19:19,980 --> 00:19:21,878
? 抉擇與聲音與聲音 ?
♪ Choices and voices and voices ♪

565
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:26,880
老媽 老爸
Mom? Dad?

566
00:19:27,780 --> 00:19:28,640
親愛的
Oh, honey.

567
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:30,860
你回來啦 怎么樣了
Hey. How did it go?

568
00:19:30,989 --> 00:19:33,903
我們最后沒結婚
Uh, we...didn't go through with it.

569
00:19:33,903 --> 00:19:34,528
什么
What?

570
00:19:34,528 --> 00:19:36,519
我們當時在24小時證婚教堂
We were at this 24-hour chapel,

571
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:39,080
當時叫到我們了 但...
and they called our names, but...

572
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:41,000
但就是有哪里感覺怪怪的
something about it just didn't feel right.

573
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:43,640
親愛的 沒關系
Sweetheart, it's okay.

574
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:46,120
時候到了你自己會知道的
You'll know when it's the right time.

575
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,880
所以我來了這里
That's why I'm here.

576
00:19:50,180 --> 00:19:51,920
我想了想你們說過的話
I thought about what you said

577
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:54,540
就是我應該擁有自己想要的婚禮
about how I should have the wedding that I want.

578
00:19:55,685 --> 00:19:58,619
我想要的婚禮是你們在場的那種
Well, the wedding that I want has you guys there.

579
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:06,620
就像婚禮鹿角一樣
And, like the nuptial antler,

580
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:09,820
你們的婚姻將堅固無比
your bond will never be broken.

581
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,760
你來收尾吧 菲爾
Take us home, Phil.

582
00:20:15,900 --> 00:20:17,440
所以
And so,

583
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:21,560
我以無痛征婚網所賦予我的權力
by the powers vested in me by NoPainOrdain.Com,

584
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:24,660
我宣布你 迪蘭
I pronounce you, Dylan...

585
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:26,720
與你 海莉
and you, Haley...

586
00:20:27,660 --> 00:20:28,580
正式成為
husband...

587
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:32,280
夫妻
...and wife.

588
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:36,620
快親新娘啊
Hey! Kiss her already!

589
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:38,788
天啊
Oh, my God.

590
00:20:43,291 --> 00:20:44,369
你想跟我談事情嗎
You want to talk to me.

591
00:20:44,369 --> 00:20:47,406
是啊 有件事這幾天一直讓我煩心
Yeah. Um... it's been bothering me the last few days.

592
00:20:47,406 --> 00:20:49,509
就是他們本來想終身 迪蘭沒有先來
Since they were gonna elope, Dylan never came to me

593
00:20:49,509 --> 00:20:51,058
求我同意讓他娶我女兒
and ask for Haley's hand in marriage.

594
00:20:51,058 --> 00:20:51,767
是啊
Yeah.

595
00:20:52,053 --> 00:20:53,100
然后我想到了
Well, then it occur to me that

596
00:20:53,100 --> 00:20:54,916
我跟克萊爾也私定終身了
since Claire and I eloped

597
00:20:54,916 --> 00:20:58,569
我當年也沒有正式去請求讓我娶你女兒
I never offically asked you for her hand in marriage.

598
00:20:58,569 --> 00:20:59,965
-所以呢... -那你問我啊
- So ah... - So ask me.

599
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:00,580
行
Okay.

600
00:21:02,201 --> 00:21:03,207
杰
Jay,

601
00:21:03,565 --> 00:21:04,899
我非常愛你女兒
I love your daughter very much.

602
00:21:04,899 --> 00:21:05,730
我想請求你...
And I would like your...

603
00:21:05,730 --> 00:21:06,572
不行
Nop.

604
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,100
很會搞笑
That's very funny.

605
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:11,260
但說真的 我很希望有你的同意與祝福
But seriously, I would very much like your blessing.

606
00:21:12,276 --> 00:21:15,231
抱歉 但我心里有些疑慮 我不同意
Sorry, I've got several conserns. I'm not onboard.

607
00:21:15,231 --> 00:21:17,232
你知道這只是走個過場吧
You realise this is just a formality.

608
00:21:17,232 --> 00:21:18,925
我和她都結婚要25年了
We've been married for more almost 25 years.

609
00:21:18,925 --> 00:21:21,469
這無數年間都沒有我的祝福
And the entire time without my blessing.

610
00:21:22,485 --> 00:21:24,209
這件事需要我買多少張狗床才能擺平
Ok, how many dog beds is this gonna cost me?

611
00:21:24,209 --> 00:21:24,701
-5張 -3張
- Five. - Three.

612
00:21:24,701 --> 00:21:25,686
-4張 -成交
- Four. - Done.

613
00:21:25,686 --> 00:21:26,405
已祝福
Blessed.
